{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412050","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1141205001:1":{"text":"There's a popular joke among bounty hunters.","source_cn":"赏金猎人这行，有个笑话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5BD7776799D2299","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141205002:1":{"text":"Starts with a simple question: Picture yourself as just an ordinary fella. Which would ya want most: wealth, honor, or unmatched strength?","source_cn":"笑话的起始是一个简单的问题：财宝、荣耀、超越想象的力量...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9520A84134919EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1141205002":{"text":"Starts with a simple question: Picture yourself as just an ordinary fella. Which would ya want most: wealth, honor, or unmatched strength?","source_cn":"笑话的起始是一个简单的问题：财宝、荣耀、超越想象的力量。如果你是个普通人，你最希望得到哪一种？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9520A84134919EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141205003:1":{"text":"Chippy chooses honor!","source_cn":"满满的话，想要荣耀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD78C29A502901389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141205004:1":{"text":"None of those. These things mean nothing to me.","source_cn":"都不要。我珍重的东西不在这些选项里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8AADE7B164FFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1141205005:1":{"text":"Now, welcome back to reality. Truth is, no matter what you pick, an ordinary fella ain't likely to snag any of those. Classic joke among us bounty hunters.","source_cn":"无论选择什么，欢迎回到现实——现实就是，这三种一般人都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD152B1871E43DA2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141205006:1":{"text":"What's the point of this question then?","source_cn":"那这个问题不是毫无意义嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DBE0EE897C4A452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141205007:1":{"text":"You'd be surprised how many folks have risked their hides chasin' after that illusory gold rush dream.","source_cn":"那是你不知道有多少为虚幻飘渺的淘金梦而搭上性命的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257B877699FACC45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141205008:1":{"text":"Sad truth is, plenty know the joke, but mighty few truly grasp it.","source_cn":"可惜，听过这个笑话的人多，听懂了的人还是太少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBCA1BAAA43EFDFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","